module frbp

/// `lit/frbp` is a base library: it declares the FRBP periods and no
/// procedure of its own. The bankruptcy-court and appeal packages that use
/// it (lit/bap8) route their graphs on its deadlines; its pack holds only
/// this placeholder terminal, which no link or case may route through.
start library

terminal library: "The Federal Rules of Bankruptcy Procedure library (no procedure)"
